abstract: >-
  Frozen repaired primary inputs, models, predictions and summaries (H1),
  all seven common-positive sensitivity recipes (G2), and a portable
  result-verification and limited scoring adapter. Historical v1.0.0 is
  retained separately. The MIT designation covers original software;
  third-party data terms are documented separately.
